{
  "$comment": [
    "What scripts/site-crops.mjs cuts out of the captures, and how. Run it with --sources <folder>.",
    "The captures are real sessions of the app, 2560 x 1440 px: a 1280 x 720 window at scale 2.",
    "rect: [x, y, width, height] in capture pixels (scale 1: one capture pixel per unit),",
    "or { \"ref\": \"path/in/the/rects/index\" } with optional pad and x/y/w/h overrides.",
    "In a list of the index, a path step is a position or an entry's name: stills/en/hero/rects/workers/Zoe/box.",
    "widths: the files written, img/<name>-<width>.avif and .webp; the page's srcset follows them.",
    "fade: pixels over which an edge the crop cuts through fades to that edge's own colour.",
    "Names ending in -m are the phone crops: one panel, drawn near its real size on a phone."
  ],
  "scale": 1,
  "rects": "../../index.json",
  "out": ".",
  "href": "img/",
  "page": "../index.html",
  "formats": {
    "avif": { "quality": 62, "speed": 4 },
    "webp": { "quality": 82, "method": 6 }
  },
  "images": {
    "hero": {
      "src": "alt/hero-r2-8.png",
      "rect": [0, 0, 2560, 1440],
      "widths": [1280, 1920, 2560],
      "marks": [
        [12, 96, 480, 452],
        [514, 94, 138, 48],
        [1250, 94, 206, 48],
        [514, 736, 648, 48],
        { "ref": "alternates/en/alt/hero-r2-8/rects/needsYouButton", "pad": [6, 6, 6, 18] },
        { "ref": "alternates/en/alt/hero-r2-8/rects/inspector", "pad": -8, "h": 770 }
      ]
    },
    "pin": { "src": "pin.png", "rect": [1270, 88, 698, 396], "widths": [448, 698] },
    "board": {
      "src": "alt/board-inspector.png",
      "rect": [504, 88, 1464, 812],
      "fade": { "bottom": 64 },
      "widths": [732, 1464]
    },
    "workers": { "src": "s-grid.png", "rect": { "ref": "stills/en/s-grid/rects/paneGrid", "w": 1720 }, "widths": [860, 1720] },
    "needs": { "src": "alt/needs-3.png", "rect": [984, 8, 880, 728], "widths": [440, 880] },
    "orch": {
      "src": "orch.png",
      "rect": { "ref": "stills/en/orch/rects/dialogs/0/box", "pad": 4 },
      "widths": [604, 1208]
    },
    "palette": {
      "src": "alt/palette-open.png",
      "rect": { "ref": "alternates/en/alt/palette-open/rects/dialogs/0/box", "pad": 6 },
      "widths": [646, 1292]
    },
    "stats": { "src": "stats.png", "rect": [504, 88, 1436, 688], "widths": [718, 1436] },
    "model": { "src": "model.png", "rect": [504, 88, 2056, 912], "widths": [1180, 2056] },

    "hero-m": {
      "src": "alt/hero-r2-8.png",
      "rect": { "ref": "alternates/en/alt/hero-r2-8/rects/orchestrator/box", "h": 460 },
      "widths": [400, 732]
    },
    "pin-m": { "src": "pin.png", "rect": [1270, 88, 698, 396], "widths": [400, 698] },
    "board-m": {
      "src": "alt/board-inspector.png",
      "rect": [1235, 190, 733, 700],
      "fade": { "bottom": 64 },
      "widths": [400, 733]
    },
    "workers-m": {
      "src": "s-grid.png",
      "rect": { "ref": "stills/en/s-grid/rects/workers/Max/box", "h": 430 },
